                <div>
                    <h5>Eliminar articulo</h5>
                    <p>Eliminá un articulo existente de la base de datos fisicamente con el endpoint <span class="p-1 fst-italic bg-info  bg-opacity-25 rounded-1">/api/articulos/{IdArticulo}</span></p>
                    <p>Request:</p>
                    <div class="border border-primary px-3 pt-3 pb-1 bg-primary bg-opacity-10 d-flex gap-3">
                        <p>[DELETE]</p>
                        <p>htps://localhost:{port}/api/articulos/6</p>
                    </div>
                </div>


